# SMB acceptance: 1-1 bonus-pipe route (G.2).
#
# Start, run to pipe 4, land on top (x in [$394,$39B]: the entry check
# at $DEE8 requires Down + foot metatiles exactly [$11,$10], i.e. feet
# straddling the two enterable-pipe-top tiles), press Down: vertical
# pipe entry to the underground coin room (first non-overworld area
# type). Cross the coin table, side-pipe exit, re-emerge on the exit
# pipe at 0A:38, run-jump the goomba pair, climb the staircase,
# flagpole (~f2880), 1-2 transition (~f3299). Recorded against the NES
# reference with FD_REF_ONLY.
